---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-25 - Open Case for Student
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADV as Advisor
    participant W as Web App
    participant SD as StudentDataController
    participant C as CasesController
    participant S as CaseService
    participant N as INotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    ADV->>W: Look at a student's data
    W->>SD: GET /api/StudentData/students/{studentId}
    SD-->>W: Consented values (access guard, logged)
    ADV->>W: Open a case with category, reason, priority
    W->>C: POST /api/Cases {studentId, supportCategoryId, requestReason, priority}
    C->>S: CreateAsync(CreatorId, request)
    S->>R: Advisor has the role of the category's type, student active with Student role, no shared attributes
    S->>R: PrepareCreate Case (advisorId = caller), PrepareCreate CaseStageHistory (pending -> assigned)
    S->>R: SaveAsync()
    R->>DB: INSERT CASES, CASESTAGEHISTORIES
    S->>S: Log activity caseOpened
    S->>N: NotifyAsync(student, "An advisor would like to meet you" with contact)
    S-->>C: CreateCaseResponse
    C-->>W: 200 OK
